Package: local-setup
Version: 0.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: estebanalpha
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: Personal .local folder scaffolding for new Termux devices
 Creates ~/.local/{bin,lib,tmp,share} plus a short README explaining the
 convention, and appends a deduplicated PATH block to .bashrc. Does not
 install or manage tools inside .local, see the repo README.
